# Accepted Trivy findings for the pnpm dependency tree.
#
# Every entry here is a transitive dependency whose only patched release is a
# major upgrade of the package that pulls it in. The npm advisory gate
# (security-audit.config.js) tracks the same risks; this file covers the NVD
# CVEs that Trivy reports under different IDs.
#
# Removal conditions are recorded per entry. Do not add an ID without one.

# @opentelemetry/propagator-jaeger 1.28.0, pulled in by
# @opentelemetry/sdk-node 0.55.0 (packages/observability). Patched only in
# propagator-jaeger 2.9.0, which ships with the 2.x SDK line. Remove after the
# observability package moves off sdk-node 0.55.
CVE-2026-59892

# @opentelemetry/core 1.28.0, same sdk-node 0.55.0 chain. Patched only in
# core 2.8.0. Remove with the sdk-node upgrade above.
CVE-2026-54285

# file-type 20.4.1, pulled in by @nestjs/common 10.4.22 (observability and
# service-auth packages). Patched only in file-type 21.x, which ships with
# Nest 11. Remove after the Nest 10 -> 11 upgrade.
CVE-2026-32630
CVE-2026-31808

# minimatch 3.1.5 / 9.0.3 / 9.0.9, reached only through build tooling
# (eslint 8, nx 20, Jest glob chains) with repo-authored patterns. Patched
# only in minimatch 11, a major bump for those tools. Remove with that upgrade.
CVE-2026-118764
